{
  "module": "kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "0f08d76870e9e18d0c2871f95570cfc8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        0,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "3616ec212ca68b1729542373d2340ab7196ec65b6d97ddd8bc03547db4ba2eaf",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「自分が強運だと想像できれば、良いものが当たるはずですわ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "09deb2fedb8fb7e9eb9bcfc6e3309787",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "4689454877290a89b7b6c585daa43b45cea9d25e85448bcca982689d0ab9cb71",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "%YOU%から抽選券を受け取ったマックイーンは、期待を込めて回し始めた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "650629db6c1430e2c7c51a4b7a6a5237",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "31ac0e27f67d83dcfe81422a0f030d85d18a21060db8e9ad94b5c5e5e663c54f",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "ぐるぐるぐる……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fe6d1c9f0c7d406e6dbbc6886ccd811a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "4c0c150a90bb2a0a587110609b403a23682bc9ac5f93caa10db7a7052a38ef8e",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "盤の中の小球が落ちるまで、マックイーンの手は止まらない。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "83cea8e3b1df018f9855e225dae8de13",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        4,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "b712ba06b29128afa76b1988f5842b47794e2f468370322bda6191648ca43be1",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "目を輝かせたマックイーンが、%YOU%の前まで歩いてくる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3d97703e029da191c861f7dcdb657c3f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        4,
        "lines",
        1,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "e92d96d506a07002a269b40c222b7b21b14cea2d0a7840db9650f3eaa55a1c91",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「%CALLNAME%、温泉旅行券が当たりましたわ！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "601dc497f0ace5015470bebb5aab33b3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        4,
        "lines",
        3,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "d0e7d2d4344f35d6b5e0574593cf3bd5168dc3397f0ee7e0d1265d3a0566b447",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「おめでとう！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0e74d0dc80fa48c377e7952e63067d80",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        4,
        "lines",
        5,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "38b5ac03d24b277e33a1543194eb61582ca4d2f9543cee9fa153190c0ce7865b",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「メジロ家にも上質な温泉宿はございますけれど、%CALLNAME%がいらっしゃるなら、普通の暮らしのほうがよろしいですわね。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e04148fe2fc044710eadb8a09d25855d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        4,
        "lines",
        6,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "ffc0ea0bab7be75c666cc26a287d6d31e6ff0b68af1cea963a2d5a036d83d076",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「それで、いつこの券を使いましょうか？ 期限はないようですわよ？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1e6db0ba7baad1c1f19b0d970d0554b7",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        4,
        "lines",
        8,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "9adf43aff78dc6bf828dfaee9765a5bb1c565cd10e8206b9a05ab879fda75c8f",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「マックイーンが卒業してからの息抜き、というのはどうだ？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "45ebc35b741c940427d00dc849096c9c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        4,
        "lines",
        10,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "6ae505eee64532e356ea02eafa0aecf82d4126387eefc36c1b463566c99b2da3",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「確かにそうですわね。では%CALLNAME%、この券は大切に保管してくださいませ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a44249b3bf3397f9962a6a77e12035d2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "o_s_drawing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "o_s_drawing",
        4,
        "lines",
        11
      ],
      "originalHash": "007aa8b8bd020d7ca865843bf156d04ce4b3187491a6c71fb561ea38c1ae7a70",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "そう言ってマックイーンは温泉旅行券を渡し、%YOU%は何度か撫でてから、丁寧に財布へしまった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5064aad27263a30eb4da4d4a51f7cec0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "29a0128ca743e0df679e4d6f0e58800c3c994bdae847a79f722e9afaef163845",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "初めての誕生日",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "965ecd3d0624df4429d4c4a301a90e73",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "64eceedd5bad9e9fb613cfb70fbf7ac2387660ee8be444b788dc8cb7a308dd3e",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "マックイーンの誕生日当日のトレーナー室では、居合わせたメジロ家の%UMA%が申し合わせたように静かに席につき、視線を同じ場所へ向けていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "15d9a5348b869d6c90d7c29ec639e1a4",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "a62043af9395fef89e8c42f76cd7146ced3b96b9f9ad56905ce0a406803276cf",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "%THEY%が見ている先は、もちろん今日の主役だ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d88f3979e33fa4697f149be65e4a0403",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "3467d0ae636f631fd521b5c1ca87b2c4a7a8acdd8dcc98359fb7434500b60908",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は両手を、目隠しをしたマックイーンの肩に置き、ゆっくり大テーブルの前まで案内した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c5b80f080dba799b4aa32a2234277b4f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        3,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "bf385c7c247346dfdab7686325b4f5f58f818daecd3e81f53e944f2cef7b417e",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「よし。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "baeb00abdd7187afb9de5377da8558ee",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "986abfe30bb6915ab6a69033406c3086446d29e10c016da7834b750dd62e8d8e",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "%YOU%が目隠しを外すと、大テーブルのそばに座っていたメジロ家の%UMA%が一斉に声を上げた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5bc25539835da66fcebec2552ec6b108",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        5,
        "content",
        0,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "ff4eb8f1c242dc78498ac4a99d8a238c03d03ef11de49d6cf7170e5b3d6a63d8",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "みんな",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "10b94e2e81cf16fe5c482102b16c3dbe",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        5,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "68b131630dae961345fa706f974dec5fc06006ea23f046c619f8306c511a632f",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「マックイーン、お誕生日おめでとう！！！！！！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "35ca24aced00ee594ad22a7ac71838a0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        6
      ],
      "originalHash": "8e07f67dc41485b51ca3fc3eec93c9b9ffc63d8e6e383dc07ec2b1308f1977dd",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "目に入ったのは、いちばん馴染み深いメジロ家の姉妹たちと、飾り立てられた壁。横断幕には「メジロマックイーンお誕生日おめでとう！」の文字がはっきりとあった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c2801bd0e407c1cd0572aae4ac35f100",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        7
      ],
      "originalHash": "17642e4fc4dd484678ddaa6717d388fe7cedca395fcc038ede3a4584306d8cba",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "マックイーンは少し驚き、それから甘く微笑んだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6bd8b92b0d214e136425d108dc76a861",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        8,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "bb43cc22662abf638d6848751c7e958ed4dac8b084d9eab64654f9981568aa0c",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「みなさま、ありがとうございます。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2897a036d3af8ea128cc39e0838e7d0a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        9
      ],
      "originalHash": "ad0901b23968ba2adc61c0bd554f8ad044aad1b7210e34e158fbb14c5c31864b",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "マックイーンが座ると、微笑みを浮かべたラモーヌが手紙を渡した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "28f105a8c5d34334bb1085304bbbf521",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        10,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "c169a611fcdd67a2d1ccd899064b55c4a3f4bc27ba65586bc93c1c1d3368484a",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "「お祖母さまからのお手紙よ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3c1f29bc703d21657ef3d91db06b2842",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        11
      ],
      "originalHash": "4b2149aa21093925957ed5e3fb08085edd968d1adc6399d73d3d047716a51f20",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "その言葉にマックイーンはすぐに耳を立て、手紙を受け取って開封し、丁寧に読み始めた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "78632b52681653bc4cd076e8ea6bd789",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        12
      ],
      "originalHash": "356d9444e507fec2b75fe64125060637e41b88536a6f9c99fc1a4f11566b4387",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "入学して初めての誕生日を祝うこと、メジロ家の悲願を改めて述べること、学園ではしっかり鍛えるように、と……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e780b6424d11b029a876ac4b3bb1c3a1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        13
      ],
      "originalHash": "7ac96c06323aa2098e8a194a445c16a64a78e8c0cf3e5326015b8ecc22e60e63",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "しばらくして、%SEX%は手紙をきちんと折りたたんだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9d5e093335123f8d6b1e89b2016ea20f",
