      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "%SEX%は手紙をしまい、表情が一気に明るくなる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "36510eed246c4559ca4e4adc8ed6a00d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
      "key": "birthday1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "birthday1",
        "lines",
        19
      ],
      "originalHash": "34a6de83cb05bffb6d8ebabaaf5e9c074c370bf291e82bd2ed2b4a297f06332a",
      "sourceFileHash": "8763b704982ec7684b115b88247cc3401abc0c806bd6f7504d1ce2d036bcb6d1",
      "originalText": "誕生日の歌を歌い、願い事をし、ケーキを分け合う流れを経て、今日もマックイーンの誕生日を祝って終わった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9639a17f578a3a6b6f93289772865542",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/daily-13.kojo",
